    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You channel the creative spark of the Progenitor Wyrms to reshape matter and energy. Choose an energy type aligned with your bloodline's patron: force or electricity for <strong>Siberys</strong>; fire or bludgeoning for <strong>Eberron</strong>; cold or void for <strong>Khyber</strong>.</p><p>Creatures in a 10-foot burst within 60 feet take 2d6 damage of the chosen type (basic Reflex save). The affected area becomes difficult terrain for 1 round as crystalline shards or earthen crags manifest before slowly dispersing.</p><p><strong>Heightened (+1):</strong> The damage increases by 2d6.</p>"
